==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Trolly Blogger]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a joke of a level and can be easily cleared with Labyrinth fodder units.

